"""
CityPulse Jaipur - update 3: code-review fixes

What this does (fixes from the code review):
  - API keys can no longer appear in terminal logs or error messages
  - personal places are private per handle (no shared "guest" bucket); API only accepts the local dashboard
  - "fly to" after search / View / routes now sticks instead of jumping back
  - faster: snapshot caching, one query for vote counts, failed map areas aren't retried every second
  - includes updates 1 and 2, so it works whichever version you have

How to use:
  1. Put this file inside your citypulse-jaipur folder.
  2. In the VS Code terminal run:   python3 apply_update.py
"""
